{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "於是，期中考試終於開始了。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "對我們這群各務台的學生來說，第一次經歷的結女考試。", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這段將近１個月的時間，在熟悉陌生環境的同時，展現出自己身為學生的實力的機會。", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過──也因為有這將近１個月的時間，我們心中萌生出了「歸屬感」。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘎啊，真的好難！新吾新吾，你最後一個問題有寫出來嗎？」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 231, "voice": "ht0157", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「寫是有寫……但不知道對不對。」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個問題是魔鬼級別喔～不過除此之外都應該答得出來呢。」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 220, "voice": "ag0279", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，與其懊悔早已結束的事情，不如再複習一下接下來要考的科目吧？」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ar0547", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理教的問題，出了。」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "sk0350", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是嗎？那個老師出題的傾向沒有變呢。」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ar0548", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊～我可能已經不行了……」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 228, "voice": "sn0099", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不可以現在就灰心放棄喔，小紗凪。接下來還很漫長呢。」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 229, "voice": "mu0181", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳沒有考試真好啊，熊喵。」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕♪」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": "pn0059", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂！不要把動物帶到學生食堂裡來啦！」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ar0549", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理，大聲的話記住的事會忘掉的。」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "sk0351", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我絕對會比你這種垃圾蟲考得更好！」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 228, "voice": "sn0100", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那種事，考卷沒有發回來前都說不準。」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「越大聲說這種話，就越像走投無路的人呢～」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 231, "voice": "ht0158", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「閉嘴垃圾蟲的同伴！」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 228, "voice": "sn0101", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔好安靜喔。」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔……安潔已經不行了……未來的主人，再見了……（倒下）」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 220, "voice": "ag0280", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有更糟的人在讓人鬆了一口氣呢……」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 228, "voice": "sn0102", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝妳，安潔……我不會忘記妳的……」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔像真的死了一樣！？」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 220, "voice": "ag0281", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
